  "visual_review": "Three actual final-run screenshots reviewed: Murphy selected meridional profile span and selected main-lobe dynamic height on desktop, plus mobile profile span. Numerical intervals, date, OSW diagnostic level, reading sensitivity, separate AXBT comparison and explicit distinction from physical diameter/depth are visible without clipping. Other regression screenshots retained without repeated manual pixel review; all browser assertions passed.",
